{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳，會見出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的俄羅斯總統普京，形容中俄關係「風雨不動安如山」，為變亂交織的世界提供更多穩定性和確定性。<br/>\n<br/>\n他又說，要深化兩國全方位合作，引領和推動世界多極化和國際關係民主化。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.063898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:07:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:17:29.879018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:26.948664+00:00","content_hash":"b809d90b9e713920bb428f1faeaa5bf45177fc8b0cf875c6afd71b227bdc68aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}